Name: readable-stream
URL: https://github.com/nodejs/readable-stream
Version: 4.8.0
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/readable-stream/-/readable-stream-4.8.0.tgz
SHA256: 318f45395a1e1f4dab40782dbbd81ec07029b5d5c9afbbf9620c6129e95a67df

Unmodified upstream lib/ sources. The runtime selects lib/stream.js so its
export is the Stream constructor, matching the Node builtin identity.
dependencies/ contains unchanged string_decoder 1.3.0, abort-controller 3.0.0,
and event-target-shim 5.0.1 sources, metadata, licenses and source hashes.
Buffer, events, process and safe-buffer are supplied by the host runtime.

bundle.js is deterministic offline composition with module-local CommonJS
scopes, generated by xenon_overlay/tools/bundle_readable_stream.cjs. Source
updates must regenerate it; --check verifies it without changing files.
Web stream adapters are provided by the overlay because upstream's adapter
loader is empty. The upstream sources themselves are not patched.
